WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.010 --> 00:00:05.410
everyone has a plan until they get punched in&nbsp;
the mouth that's one of my favorite lines from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:10.270
boxer Mike Tyson, but it's also a humbling&nbsp;
reality about business. Even for the best&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.270 --> 00:00:16.030
run companies things will inevitably get off&nbsp;
track, but a concept called process mining&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.030 --> 00:00:21.790
can help essentially. Process mining extracts&nbsp;
data from an organization to see how it truly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:27.370
functions not theoretically on paper ,but out&nbsp;
in the real world where things are messy. With&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:32.650
process mining organizations can uncover all&nbsp;
those hidden inefficiencies and inertia better&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:38.650
yet process mining also empowers organizations to&nbsp;
see how changes they are considering can impact&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.650 --> 00:00:43.870
their key performance metrics. It's like running&nbsp;
trial and error without the consequences of error

